# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Pauli propagation"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan untuk versi terkini perambatan Pauli"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Arahan pemasangan {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, cipta persekitaran minimum yang hanya mempunyai Python dipasang di dalamnya. Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan [persekitaran maya Python](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan persekitaran baharu anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua cara utama untuk memasang pakej ini – daripada PyPI atau sumber. Kaedah yang diutamakan ialah memasang daripada PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Pasang daripada sumber {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install from source if you want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh memasang daripada sumber jika anda ingin membangunkan dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara setempat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `pauli-prop` repository.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, klon repositori `pauli-prop`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, pasang rantai alat Rust, naik taraf pip, dan masuk ke repositori. Rujuk [dokumentasi Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) untuk arahan memasang rantai alat tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `pauli-prop` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you want to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, you can install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya ialah memasang `pauli-prop` ke dalam persekitaran maya. Pasang kebergantungan notebook jika anda ingin menjalankan semua visualisasi dalam notebook. Jika anda merancang untuk membangunkan dalam repositori, anda boleh memasang kebergantungan `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Laraskan pilihan di bawah mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda telah memasang kebergantungan notebook, anda boleh bermula dengan menjalankan notebook dalam dokumen.\n"
